<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine domestic oilseed/wheat industry snapshot.</title>
<headline>Argentine domestic oilseed/wheat industry snapshot.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Agriculture Secretariat</p>
<p>weekly estimates, to June 25, of total 1996/97 purchases</p>
<p>by Argentine oilseed crushers and wheat millers in the</p>
<p>indicated crop year (thousands of tonnes):</p>
<p> Bread Wheat	  3,750.8</p>
<p> Soybeans	     5,842.3</p>
<p> Sunseeds	     4,357.2</p>
<p>((-- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655))</p>
</text>
